                <head>No. 1175<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>At the 147th meeting of the National Security Council on June 1, Secretary
                        Dulles discussed the situation in the
                    Near East and South Asia, including Egypt. For text of the memorandum of
                    discussion at the meeting, see <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v09p1/d137">Document
                        137</ref>.</p>
            </div>
